      <h1 class="jr-h1">Winter Joint Pain: Why Does Cold Weather Make It Worse?</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">Every November the same sentence arrives in the clinic: my knees were fine in October. Almost every article you will find blames the cold for thickening the fluid inside your joints, and that explanation rests on thinner evidence than the explanation nobody writes about.</p>

